#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:37 index.docbook:51
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kcoloredit; is a palette files editor. It can be used for editing color "
"palettes and for color choosing and naming."
msgstr ""
"&kcoloredit; je urednik datoteka paleta.  Može se koristiti za uređivanje "
"palete boja i izbor i imenovanje boja."

#. Tag: keyword
#: index.docbook:42
#, no-c-format
msgid "<keyword>KDE</keyword>"
msgstr "<keyword>KDE</keyword>"

#. Tag: keyword
#: index.docbook:43
#, no-c-format
msgid "graphics"
msgstr "grafika"

#. Tag: keyword
#: index.docbook:44
#, no-c-format
msgid "palette"
msgstr "paleta"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:49
#, no-c-format
msgid "Introduction"
msgstr "Uvod"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:57
#, no-c-format
msgid "File operations"
msgstr "Operacije sa datotekom"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:60
#, no-c-format
msgid "About palette files"
msgstr "O datotekama palete"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:62
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The palette files installed by &kde; can be either system-wide or the user "
"ones. The latter are in you private &kde; configuration folders, and they "
"are named <guilabel>Custom Colors</guilabel> and <guilabel>Recent Colors</"
"guilabel>."
msgstr ""
"Paletne datoteke instalirane sa &kde; mogu biti sistemske ili korisničke. "
"Ove druge su u vašem privatnom &kde; konfiguracionom direktoriju, i zovu se "
"<guilabel> Vlastite boje </guilabel> i <guilabel> Nedavne boje </guilabel>."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:69
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In &kcoloredit;, you may open all of these palettes, as well as palettes in "
"arbitrary files."
msgstr ""
"U  &kcoloredit;, možete otvoriti sve ove palete, kao i palete u proizvoljnim "
"datotekama."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:77
#, no-c-format
msgid "Opening a file"
msgstr "Otvaranje datoteke"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:78
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the <guilabel>Open File</guilabel> dialog, you may choose from a list of "
"installed palettes, or browse folders for files."
msgstr ""
"U dijalogu <guilabel> Open File </guilabel>, možete odabrati s popisa "
"instaliranih paleta, ili pregledati mape za datoteke."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:87
#, no-c-format
msgid "Editing"
msgstr "Uređivanje"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:90
#, no-c-format
msgid "Cursor"
msgstr "Kursor"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:92
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The cursor is visible as a line in the palette view. It can be moved by "
"clicking on an area beside a color."
msgstr ""
"Kursor je vidljiv kao linija u pregledu palete. Može biti premješten klikom "
"na površinu pored boje."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:95
#, no-c-format
msgid "The cursor has the following functions:"
msgstr "Kursor ima sljedeće funkcije:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:99
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It points to the color after it. The color, if any, is described below the "
"palette view. You may edit its name there."
msgstr ""
"Pokazuje na boju nakon nje. Boja, ako ih ima, opisana je ispod pregleda "
"palete. Tamo možete uređivati ime."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:105
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"It can be used to make a selection. A selection can be made by clicking on "
"an area beside a color, so to move the cursor there, and by moving the mouse "
"then with the left mouse button pressed."
msgstr ""
"Može se koristiti za pravljenje izbora. Izbor možete napraviti klikom na "
"površinu pored boje, tako da bi se kursor pomjerio tamo, i sa pomicanjem "
"miša sa pritisnutom lijevom tipkom miša."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:112
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If the <guilabel>At cursor</guilabel> check-box near the <guilabel>Add "
"Color</guilabel> button is checked, a color from the color chooser is put at "
"the cursor. The color is either inserted or it overwrites another one, "
"depending on whether the <guilabel>Overwrite</guilabel> mode is chosen. The "
"mode can be chosen by checking the <guilabel>Overwrite</guilabel> check-box, "
"that is next to the <guilabel>At cursor</guilabel> one."
msgstr ""
"Ako je <guilabel> Na kursoru</guilabel> kućica u blizini <guilabel> Dodaj "
"boju </guilabel> dugmeta označena, boja iz izbornika boja  se stavlja na "
"kursor. Boja je ili umetnuta ili preklapa drugu, ovisno o tome da li je "
"izabran <guilabel> Prepisivanje </guilabel> režim. Režim može biti izabran "
"označavanjem<guilabel> Prepisivanje </guilabel> kućice, koja se nalazi pored "
"onog <guilabel> Na kursoru </guilabel>."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:125
#, no-c-format
msgid "Selection"
msgstr "Izbor"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:126
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A selection, that can be made as it was written in the previous section, can "
"be used with the copy, cut and paste operations."
msgstr ""
"Izbor, koji može biti kao što je napisano u prethodnom poglavlju, može se "
"koristiti sa kopiraj, isjeci i umetni operacijama."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:133
#, no-c-format
msgid "Clipboard format"
msgstr "Formatiranje međuspremnika"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:134
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kcoloredit; uses the following format for clipboard data: for each color "
"three numbers for red, green and blue components, respectively, and an "
"optional color name, followed by a new line character if there is another "
"color. Therefore, if for example three numbers are in the clipboard, they "
"can be pasted by &kcoloredit; as a color."
msgstr ""
"&kcoloredit; koristi sljedeće formate za podatke iz međuspremnika: za svaku "
"boju tri broja za crvenu, zelenu i plavu komponentu, respektivno, i "
"optimalno ime boje, praćeno sa znakom novog reda ako postoji druga boja. "
"Stoga, ako su na primjer tri broja u međuspremniku, oni mogu biti umetnuti "
"sa &kcoloredit; kao boje."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:146
#, no-c-format
msgid "Selecting a color from an RGB space"
msgstr "Odabir boje iz RGB prostora"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:148
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A color can be selected from an RGB space in &kcoloredit; in the following "
"ways:"
msgstr ""
"Boja može biti odabrana iz RGB prostora u &kcoloredit; na sljedeće načine:"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:153
#, no-c-format
msgid "By editing the HSV or RGB components."
msgstr "Editovanjem HSV ili RGB komponenti."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:158
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"By selecting a color from color gradient panels. In the left one, two from "
"HSV components can be selected, and in the right one, the third one. The "
"third component can be chosen by clicking on one of the buttons labeled "
"<guilabel>H:</guilabel>, <guilabel>S:</guilabel> and <guilabel>V:</"
"guilabel>. The one component panel display colors with the other two "
"components equal to these selected in the two components panel. The two "
"components panel may display colors with the third component fixed, or, if "
"the <guilabel>Variable</guilabel> check-box is set, with a value equal to "
"the one selected in the one component panel. In the <guilabel>Replace</"
"guilabel> mode, the color selected in panels replaces the output one "
"instantly, and in the <guilabel>Change:</guilabel> mode it modifies the "
"output color after each click, or a mouse move while a mouse button is "
"pressed. Therefore, in the latter mode the color selected in the gradient "
"panels may be different from the output color. To synchronize the colors, "
"the <guibutton>Synchronize</guibutton> button can be used."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:185
#, no-c-format
msgid "Drag and drop"
msgstr "Povlačenje i puštanje"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:186
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The palette colors and the color selection output color can be dragged with "
"a mouse."
msgstr "Paleta boja i izlazna boja izbora boja može se povući mišem."

